    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Dwarf, gnome, or goblin</em></p><p>You are uncommonly nimble for your race. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>Increase your walking speed by 5 feet.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency in the Acrobatics or Athletics skill (your choice).</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on any Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Acrobatics) check you make to escape from being grappled.</p></li></ul>",
